# Idle Kingdoms agent workflow

Read and follow `docs/AGENT_WORKFLOW.md` and `AGENTS.md` before writing code.

- Owner sends instructions → share a plan → stop until they confirm.
- Branch from the latest `origin/test-launch` and open a pull request targeting `test-launch` (https://test.restoriaidle.com).
- Never commit or push to `main`. Only Conor promotes `test-launch` to `main` by manually merging a PR (https://restoriaidle.com).
- Migrations still owed to live are listed under "Pending on live" in `docs/deployment.md`. Apply them to the live project only after Conor merges.
